      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "for now, you can also go to <Project>\\Library\\PackageCache\\com.unity.postprocessing@3.1.1\\PostProcessing and delete the Shaders and Textures folders to reduce your worlds filesize (textures) and build-time (shader compile time)\nor try my script which strips the shaders/passes listed above:\nhttps://github.com/Float3/3s-Unity-Shaders-Scripts/blob/master/Assets/Scripts/3/Editor/ShaderPreProcessor.cs",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-09-12T17:15:03.698Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Post Processing shaders should always be stripped from building since VRChat replaces them anyways. Unnecessary buildtime.\n\nEdit: Additionally, I believe passes with the following types should also be stripped since they are either Legacy deferred or EditorOnly: PassType.Deferred, PassType.LightPrePassBase, PassType.LightPrePassFinal, PassType.VertexLM, PassType.Meta",
